@startuml
title System Flow Architecture: Forward-Secure Lattice-Based IBE for IoT
caption Setup → Key Distribution → Data Encryption → Query & Trust Verification → Data Retrieval → Forward Security

left to right direction
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam packageStyle rectangle
skinparam componentStyle rectangle
skinparam defaultFontName Arial
skinparam ArrowFontName Arial
skinparam ArrowFontSize 12
skinparam packageBorderStyle dashed
skinparam packageBackgroundColor white

package "Data Producer\n(IoT Environment)" as Producer {
  database "Raw Sensor Data" as Raw
  component "IoT End Device" as Device
  component "Edge Device" as Edge
  component "IoT Edge Gateway\n(FL Client)" as Gateway #EAF2FA
}

package "Trust Manager Framework" as Framework {
  cloud "Trusted System Infrastructure\nCentralized Authority" as Infrastructure #EAF6FC
  component "Regulatory Authority (TA)\nKey generation · Epoch updates" as TA #F2E6F5
  component "Access Control Gateway\nAuth coordination · Orchestrator" as Access #EAF2FA
  component "Trust Manager & Verifier\nScore threshold · Dilithium-3 verify" as Trust #E7F3E8
  component "ML Trust Scorer\nBehavior features · Anomaly score" as ML #E7F3E8
  component "Encrypted Storage\nEpoch-bound fs-IBE ciphertexts" as Storage #F8E8E8
  component "Federated Aggregator\nUpdate validation · FedAvg" as Aggregator #F2E6F5
}

package "Data Consumer\n(Authorized User)" as Consumer {
  actor "User (Requester)" as User
  component "Query Terminal" as Terminal #E8F8E8
  component "Network Node" as Network #FFF0E5
  component "Analytics Viewer" as Analytics #F5EAF7
}

' Preserve the original architecture flow and numbering.
TA -[#79509A]-> Device : 1 MPK & Parameters
Device -[#2878B5]-> Access : 2 Device Registration
TA -[#4C8A56]-> User : 3 FS Epoch Key (sk)
Edge -[#C47A43]-> Storage : 4 Encrypted Upload (fs-IBE)
TA -[#79509A]-> Analytics : 5 MPK & Parameters
Terminal -[#2878B5]-> Trust : 6 Q = {Keyword, Signature, Epoch}
' ML scoring is inserted into the existing query verification path.
Trust -[#4C8A56]-> ML : 6.1 Query behavior features
ML -[#4C8A56]-> Trust : 6.2 ML trust / anomaly score
Trust -[#4C8A56]-> Terminal : 7 Verified / Trust Score Updated
Storage -[#C47A43]-> Network : 8 Ciphertext; decrypt locally
TA -[#777777,dashed]-> Device : 9 Epoch Update (t → t+1)
TA -[#777777,dashed]-> User : 9 Epoch Update (t → t+1)

Trust -[#B33A3A]-> Terminal : Reject: low score, early-reject anomaly,\nor invalid signature

' Federated learning is shown as an update loop within the framework.
Gateway -[#4C8A56]-> Gateway : 10 Train local model; keep raw traffic local
Gateway -[#79509A]-> Aggregator : 11 Quantized update, fs-IBE encrypted\nand Dilithium-3 signed
Aggregator -[#4C8A56]-> Aggregator : 12 Check gateway trust, epoch, signature;\nFedAvg accepted updates
Aggregator -[#4C8A56]-> ML : 13 Publish aggregated model for scoring
Aggregator -[#2878B5]-> Gateway : 14 Return global model and current epoch

legend bottom
  |= Line color |= Meaning |
  |<#79509A> Purple | Setup / MPK / federated update protection |
  |<#2878B5> Blue | Registration / query / model distribution |
  |<#4C8A56> Green | Key / trust / ML scoring / aggregation |
  |<#C47A43> Orange | Encryption / ciphertext retrieval |
  |<#B33A3A> Red | Rejection / trust penalty |
  |<#777777> Dashed gray | Epoch channel |
endlegend
@enduml
